  "description": "Generate Code 39 and Code 128 barcodes as SVG strings. Zero dependencies, no System.Drawing, no native libraries — works anywhere including Linux containers. Vector output stays sharp at any size, so it embeds cleanly into HTML, PDFs and print stylesheets. Includes spec-required quiet zones and the mandatory Code 128 check symbol.",
